---
// GuideSection.astro
---

<section id="guide" class="space-y-8 pt-8 border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-3">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
      Essential Aspirant Advice
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
      Why Signatures Get Rejected in Indian Govt Portals
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      Thousands of candidates face application rejection every year due to technical signature discrepancies. Follow these crucial guidelines to ensure your submission passes automated validation on the first attempt.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Rejection Reasons Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        1
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Signing in Capital Letters (ALL CAPS)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        SSC, IBPS, and Railway RRB explicitly state that signatures in <strong>BLOCK / CAPITAL letters</strong> will be disqualified. A signature must be your customary running cursive hand.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        2
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">File Size Below Minimum (e.g. &lt; 10 KB)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Portals like SSC CGL and IBPS reject files below <strong>10 KB</strong> just as strictly as files over 20 KB. SignResize uses smart precision compression that guarantees your file lands strictly between 10 KB and 20 KB.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        3
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Dark Shadow & Gray Paper Background</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Photos taken under indoor yellow lighting or casting telephone shadows are rejected by OCR scanners. Our <strong>Clean White Paper</strong> tool algorithmically whitens the paper while maintaining sharp ink density.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Visual Workflow Proof: Real-World Before vs After Processing -->
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-primary font-mono">Helpful Content Visual Proof</span>
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Real-World Processing: Raw Mobile Photo vs SignResize Output
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        See how our in-browser engine eliminates rejection triggers before you submit your application.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      
      <!-- Visual Proof Card 1: Mobile Phone Yellow Paper & Shadow Cleanup -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
              Case 1: Shadow &amp; Yellow Paper
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold">SSC / IBPS</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Before / After Visual Container -->
          <figure class="space-y-2.5" aria-label="SSC signature upload error fixed by removing gray background shadow">
            <!-- Raw Photo (Before) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-amber-100/70 dark:bg-amber-950/40 text-center overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-red-500 text-white tracking-wide">
                Raw Mobile Photo (Rejected ✕)
              </span>
              <!-- SVG Mockup of Dark/Shadowy Raw Signature -->
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14 opacity-85" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Raw mobile phone photo with yellow paper tint and hand shadow">
                  <title>Raw mobile phone signature photo with dark shadow</title>
                  <desc>Unprocessed smartphone photo casting dark yellow shadow over white paper signature.</desc>
                  <!-- Hand / Phone Shadow Overlay -->
                  <path d="M0 0 L140 0 L90 70 L0 70 Z" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.12)" />
                  <!-- Faded / Low-contrast signature strokes -->
                  <path d="M20 45 C40 20, 60 55, 75 32 C90 12, 110 40, 130 28 C150 18, 170 50, 195 38" stroke="#4a4238" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path d="M50 48 L170 46" stroke="#4a4238" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-medium flex items-center justify-between border-t border-red-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 3.4 MB</span>
                <span>Shadow Detected • Dull Paper</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transformation Arrow -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[11px]">Clean White Paper 3.0 + 140×60 Crop</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Cleaned Output (After) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-center shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wide">
                SignResize Output (Approved ✓)
              </span>
              <!-- SVG Mockup of Cleaned Black Ink on Pure White Paper -->
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="SSC signature upload error fixed by removing gray background shadow">
                  <title>SSC signature upload error fixed by removing gray background shadow</title>
                  <desc>SignResize output showing crisp black ink signature on pure #FFFFFF white background cropped to 140x60 pixels and 14.8 KB.</desc>
                  <!-- Crisp high contrast strokes on pure #FFFFFF -->
                  <path d="M20 45 C40 20, 60 55, 75 32 C90 12, 110 40, 130 28 C150 18, 170 50, 195 38" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path d="M50 48 L170 46" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between border-t border-emerald-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 14.8 KB (10–20 KB Bound)</span>
                <span>Pure #FFFFFF • 140×60 px</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border">
          <strong>Result:</strong> Removes indoor yellow lighting and phone shadows while preserving 100% of cursive ink stroke fidelity for automated OCR.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Proof Card 2: Dual-Boundary Floor (Preventing "Must Be at Least 20 KB") -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
              Case 2: "Size Must Be &ge; 20 KB"
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold">UPSC / State PSC</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Before / After Visual Container -->
          <figure class="space-y-2.5" aria-label="UPSC signature size error under 20KB fixed with 20KB floor guard">
            <!-- Over-compressed file (Before) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-muted/40 text-center overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-red-500 text-white tracking-wide">
                Generic Resizer (Rejected ✕)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14 opacity-70" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Over-compressed blurry signature file under 20 KB limit">
                  <title>Over-compressed signature image under 20 KB limit</title>
                  <desc>Generic image compressor shrinking file to 7.2 KB causing rejection due to UPSC 20 KB minimum size limit.</desc>
                  <!-- Pixelated, blurred over-compressed lines -->
                  <path d="M30 40 C50 15, 70 50, 90 30 C110 10, 130 45, 170 30" stroke="#71717a" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-medium flex items-center justify-between border-t border-red-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 7.2 KB (&lt; 20 KB Floor)</span>
                <span>Blurry Quantization</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transformation Arrow -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[11px]">SignResize 20 KB Floor Guard</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Safe output (After) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-center shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wide">
                SignResize Output (Approved ✓)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="UPSC signature size error under 20KB fixed with 20KB floor guard">
                  <title>UPSC signature size error under 20KB fixed with 20KB floor guard</title>
                  <desc>SignResize output maintaining 24.5 KB file weight with sharp 350x350 px resolution for UPSC online portal acceptance.</desc>
                  <!-- Smooth anti-aliased black stroke -->
                  <path d="M30 40 C50 15, 70 50, 90 30 C110 10, 130 45, 170 30" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between border-t border-emerald-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 24.5 KB (20–50 KB Safe)</span>
                <span>UPSC 350×350 px Valid</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border">
          <strong>Result:</strong> Binary-search quantization ensures file size never falls below UPSC's 20 KB floor while keeping file weight under maximum limits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Proof Card 3: Left Thumb Impression (RRB & Banking) -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
              Case 3: Thumb Impression 1:1
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold">RRB / SBI PO</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Before / After Visual Container -->
          <figure class="space-y-2.5" aria-label="RRB left thumb impression 1:1 square crop auto formatted">
            <!-- Skewed thumb photo (Before) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-muted/40 text-center overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-red-500 text-white tracking-wide">
                Uneven Aspect (Rejected ✕)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 70" class="w-24 h-14 opacity-75" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Distorted 3:2 ratio thumb impression image">
                  <title>Distorted non-square thumb impression photo</title>
                  <desc>Raw thumb impression photo with distorted aspect ratio and smudged ink lines.</desc>
                  <!-- Distorted oval fingerprint -->
                  <ellipse cx="50" cy="35" rx="36" ry="24" stroke="#1d4ed8" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="4 2" />
                  <ellipse cx="50" cy="35" rx="24" ry="15" stroke="#1d4ed8" stroke-width="1.8" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-medium flex items-center justify-between border-t border-red-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Distorted 3:2 Ratio</span>
                <span>Fuzzy Ink Smudge</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transformation Arrow -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[11px]">1:1 Square Crop + Ridge Sharpener</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Cleaned square thumb output (After) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-center shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wide">
                SignResize Output (Approved ✓)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 70 70" class="w-14 h-14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="RRB left thumb impression 1:1 square crop auto formatted">
                  <title>RRB left thumb impression 1:1 square crop auto formatted</title>
                  <desc>SignResize output formatting left thumb impression into 1:1 ratio 240x240 pixels at 18.2 KB with sharp biometric whorls.</desc>
                  <!-- Perfect 1:1 concentric ridges -->
                  <ellipse cx="35" cy="35" rx="26" ry="26" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2.2" />
                  <ellipse cx="35" cy="35" rx="18" ry="18" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2" />
                  <ellipse cx="35" cy="35" rx="10" ry="10" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between border-t border-emerald-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 18.2 KB (10–50 KB Bound)</span>
                <span>Exact 240×240 px (1:1)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border">
          <strong>Result:</strong> Locks 1:1 square crop aspect ratio at 200 DPI resolution, ensuring biometric loops and whorls remain clearly distinguishable.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step-by-Step Mobile Photo Guide & Interactive Walkthrough -->
  <div id="guide-walkthrough" class="p-5 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-sm space-y-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border/60 pb-4">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Video Walkthrough &bull; 0:35 HD
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-muted-foreground">Mobile &amp; Desktop</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mt-1 flex items-center gap-2">
          How to Capture &amp; Resize Signature on Mobile (4-Step Video Demonstration)
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-muted text-muted-foreground border border-border">
          Takes ~30 Seconds
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Walkthrough Player Asset -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-gradient-to-b from-muted/40 via-muted/20 to-card p-4 sm:p-6 space-y-4 shadow-inner">
      <!-- Player Top Bar -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button
            type="button"
            id="walkthrough-play-toggle"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition active:scale-95 cursor-pointer shadow-xs"
            aria-label="Play or Pause Walkthrough"
          >
            <svg id="walkthrough-play-icon" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 hidden" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3" />
            </svg>
            <svg id="walkthrough-pause-icon" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="6" y="4" width="4" height="16" rx="1" />
              <rect x="14" y="4" width="4" height="16" rx="1" />
            </svg>
            <span id="walkthrough-play-text">Pause Demo</span>
          </button>
          <span id="walkthrough-time-indicator" class="font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">0:12 / 0:35</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Step Selector Pills -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap" role="tablist" aria-label="Walkthrough Steps">
          <button type="button" class="walkthrough-step-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium border border-primary bg-primary/10 text-primary transition" data-step="0">1. Capture</button>
          <button type="button" class="walkthrough-step-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium border border-border bg-background text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition" data-step="1">2. Crop</button>
          <button type="button" class="walkthrough-step-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium border border-border bg-background text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition" data-step="2">3. Clean #FFF</button>
          <button type="button" class="walkthrough-step-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium border border-border bg-background text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition" data-step="3">4. 10-20 KB</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Animated Scrub Bar -->
      <div class="w-full bg-muted-foreground/20 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
        <div id="walkthrough-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-indigo-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 25%;"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Video Display Stage / Canvas Mockup -->
      <div class="relative w-full aspect-[16/9] sm:aspect-[21/9] max-h-[320px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-black/95 flex items-center justify-center select-none">
        
        <!-- Stage 0: Mobile Capture Viewfinder -->
        <div id="demo-stage-0" class="walkthrough-stage absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100">
          <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm h-36 border-2 border-dashed border-amber-400/80 rounded-xl bg-amber-100/10 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 bg-black/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
              CAM VIEW &bull; A4 White Paper
            </div>
            <!-- Hand / Phone Shadow & Rough Signature -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 60" class="w-48 h-14" fill="none">
              <path d="M0 0 L110 0 L70 60 L0 60 Z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.06)" />
              <path d="M20 40 C40 18, 60 50, 80 28 C100 12, 120 42, 140 26 C160 14, 175 42, 190 34" stroke="#a1a1aa" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-3 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-black text-[10px] font-bold shadow-md">
              Step 1: Snap photo parallel to paper in good light
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 1: Auto-Crop to 140x60 px -->
        <div id="demo-stage-1" class="walkthrough-stage absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 pointer-events-none">
          <div class="relative w-64 h-28 border-2 border-primary rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center p-3 shadow-lg">
            <span class="absolute -top-3 left-3 bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-mono text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow">
              Preset: SSC / RRB (140×60 px)
            </span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 160 50" class="w-40 h-12" fill="none">
              <path d="M15 32 C35 15, 55 42, 75 22 C95 8, 115 35, 130 20 C145 10, 150 28, 155 24" stroke="#e4e4e7" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
            <span class="absolute -bottom-3 right-3 bg-card border border-border text-foreground font-mono text-[9px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow">
              4.0 cm × 2.0 cm @ 200 DPI
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 2: Clean White Paper 3.0 Filter -->
        <div id="demo-stage-2" class="walkthrough-stage absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 pointer-events-none">
          <div class="relative w-64 h-28 border-2 border-emerald-500 rounded-lg bg-white text-zinc-950 flex items-center justify-center p-3 shadow-xl">
            <span class="absolute -top-3 left-3 bg-emerald-600 text-white font-mono text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow">
              Clean White Paper 3.0: ON (#FFFFFF)
            </span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 160 50" class="w-40 h-12" fill="none">
              <!-- Jet Black Crisp High-Contrast Strokes -->
              <path d="M15 32 C35 15, 55 42, 75 22 C95 8, 115 35, 130 20 C145 10, 150 28, 155 24" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
            <span class="absolute -bottom-3 left-3 bg-emerald-700 text-white font-mono text-[9px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow">
              Zero Yellow Hue &bull; OCR Sharp
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 3: Dual-Boundary 10-20 KB Export -->
        <div id="demo-stage-3" class="walkthrough-stage absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 pointer-events-none">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/50 bg-card/90 max-w-sm w-full space-y-2 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
                Dual-Boundary Verified
              </span>
              <span class="text-primary font-bold">14.8 KB &le; 20 KB</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-muted h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div class="bg-emerald-500 h-full rounded-full" style="width: 74%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-muted-foreground font-mono pt-1">
              <span>Floor: &gt; 10.0 KB</span>
              <span>Actual: 14.8 KB</span>
              <span>Ceiling: &lt; 20.0 KB</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-1">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow">
                ✓ Ready for SSC / RRB / UPSC Upload
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Active Stage Badge Overlay -->
        <div class="absolute top-2 right-2 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-black/70 backdrop-blur border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-300">
          <span id="demo-stage-caption">Step 1: Sign &amp; Align</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Step Summary Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary/40 transition">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 01</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Sign on Clean White Paper</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Use an unruled, plain A4 white sheet. For SSC and IBPS, use a <strong>black ink pen</strong> (gel or ballpoint) in running cursive handwriting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary/40 transition">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 02</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Photograph in Good Light</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Hold your phone directly parallel to the paper. Avoid casting direct shadows from your hand or device across the signature stroke lines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary/40 transition">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 03</span>
