          Upload your image to SignResize. Tap your target exam (SSC, RRB, UPSC, PAN) to auto-lock official aspect ratios and kilobyte limit bounds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary/40 transition">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 04</span>
